<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>牙科保险 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%89%99%E7%A7%91%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9/</link><description>Recent content in 牙科保险 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%89%99%E7%A7%91%E4%BF%9D%E9%99%A9/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>看牙：约洗牙、说牙疼、补牙与根管、费用与保险覆盖、牙套咨询</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/dentist/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/dentist/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在美国看牙，第一件要搞清的事是：&lt;strong&gt;牙科保险（dental insurance）和医疗保险是分开的两套&lt;/strong&gt;。牙科保险基本都单独买，多数人通过雇主拿到（Delta Dental、Cigna、MetLife 这类），进牙科诊所刷的是牙科保险卡，不是医保卡。所以打电话约牙医，前台最先问的往往是保险，而不是&amp;quot;你哪里不舒服&amp;quot;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>